{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "%@ 已下载，空闲或退出时安装": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ downloaded. It will install when 1shot is idle or quits."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（%@）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ (%2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1shot %@ 已下载好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1shot %@ Is Ready"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1shot %@ 是目前的最新版本。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1shot %@ is the latest version."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1shot 截图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1shot Screenshot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1shot 设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1shot Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1shot 需要屏幕录制权限才能截取屏幕画面。截图只保存在你的电脑上，不会上传。\n\n请在「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 屏幕录制」中打开 1shot 的开关。如果打开后仍然无法截图，请退出并重新打开 1shot。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1shot needs Screen Recording permission to capture the screen. Screenshots stay on your Mac and are never uploaded.\n\nTurn on 1shot in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Screen Recording. If capturing still doesn’t work afterwards, quit and reopen 1shot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "C 复制颜色  ⇧ 切换格式": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C copy color  ⇧ switch format"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "save-directory-name": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screenshots"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "截图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次检查：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last checked: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不再显示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Don’t show again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不透明度": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opacity"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不需要": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not needed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不需要。1shot 不读取键盘输入，也不控制其他 App。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not needed. 1shot doesn’t read your keystrokes or control other apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Medium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中号字": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Medium text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为不同的截图方式设置全局快捷键，在任何 App 里都能使用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set global shortcuts for each capture mode. They work in any app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "以后不再显示复制、保存完成的提示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop showing notifications after copying or saving"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存位置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Location"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存失败：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save failed: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存截图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save Screenshot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存最近 %lld 张截图，可以重新复制、贴图。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps the last %lld screenshots so you can copy or pin them again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保留截图历史": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep screenshot history"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "像素化": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pixelate"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "全选": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select All"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关于": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "About"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭全部贴图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close All Pins"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭贴图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Close pin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "再按截图快捷键也可以完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press the capture shortcut again to finish"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "删除": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "前往下载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "前往允许": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "剪切": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cut"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "剪贴板里没有可以贴的图片或文字": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing on the clipboard to pin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原始大小": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Actual Size"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发现新版本 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Version %@ available"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发现新版本 1shot %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1shot %@ Is Available"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "另存为": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save As"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "另存为…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save As…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "另存为（⌘S）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Save As (⌘S)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同时写入 PNG 和 TIFF，粘贴到任何 App 都清晰。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Writes both PNG and TIFF, so pasting stays sharp in any app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "图片编码失败。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Couldn’t encode the image."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圆角": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Corners"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圆角与阴影": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Corners & Shadow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圆角按截图短边的百分比计算，截图越大圆角越大。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Corner radius is a percentage of the shorter side, so larger screenshots get larger corners."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "圆角矩形": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rounded rectangle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在后台下载并校验，1shot 空闲或退出时安装，不打断你。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloads and verifies in the background, then installs when 1shot is idle or quits."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在访达中打开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open in Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在访达中显示": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show in Finder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "坐标 (%@, %@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Position (%1$@, %2$@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制、保存后在选区附近短暂提示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Briefly show a message near the selection after copying or saving."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制、保存的是四周透明的 PNG；贴图和截图历史保留原图。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copied and saved images become PNGs with a transparent border. Pins and history keep the original."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制并收起工具栏（Enter）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy and hide toolbar (Enter)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制文字": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy Text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "复制（双击缩略图也可以）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy (or double-click the thumbnail)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "大号字": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Large text"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装包内容不正确：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The update package is invalid: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "安装包校验失败（SHA-256 不一致）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The update failed verification (SHA-256 mismatch)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成、另存为、贴图和长截图都会记录在这里（最多 %lld 条）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Captures you finish, save, pin or scroll-capture show up here (up to %lld)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成并复制": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done and copy"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成截图后": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After Capture"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将删除 %lld 张历史截图，不影响保存目录里的文件。此操作无法撤销。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This deletes %lld screenshots from history. Files in your save folder are not affected. This can’t be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
